                            {
                                "example_id": "c44f5f31-f66f-4205-aab8-54674ad6b01b",
                                "sense_id": "7863b241-841b-341f-9736-6a1e67f5a7ba",
                                "text": "Мы скуча́ем то́лько голово́ю, а он скуча́л весь наскво́зь, сни́зу до́верху: скуча́ла его́ фура́жка, с бесце́льным молоде́чеством сдви́нутая набекре́нь, скуча́ли шпо́ры и тре́нькали дисгармони́чно, враздро́бь, как глухи́е.",
                                "translation": "We are bored only in the head, but he was bored in every part of him, from head to foot: his cap, cocked on one side with youthful lack of purpose, was bored, his spurs were bored and tinkled inharmoniously and irregularly as though muffled.",
                                "english": "We are bored only in the head, but he was bored in every part of him, from head to foot: his cap, cocked on one side with youthful lack of purpose, was bored, his spurs were bored and tinkled inharmoniously and irregularly as though muffled."
